nt": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le06ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Phrasal Verbs about Phone Communication"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. Some phrasal verbs are unique to communication on the phone."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Here are more phrasal verbs that are often used for communication over the phone or videochats. Try to use some of these the next time you're chatting."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak louder into the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to hang up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to end a conversation and put down the phone or pushing \u201cend\u201d on the phone.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to cut off\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to interrupt a phone conversation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call someone again or in return\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to break up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" when the other person's voice is unclear and you can't hear them well\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you please speak up a little? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Just hang up and call me back when you can."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You're breaking up ... I can hardly hear you."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Sorry, we got cut off there ... what were you saying?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Changing Topics on the Phone"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use expressions to redirect a phone conversation when you wish to get off the current topic or to focus on a different topic."}, {"type": "text", "content": "To state a reason to get off the topic, you can use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I can't look up my calendar right now. Let me get back to you on that.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To direct the other person's attention to another topic, you can use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">By the way, we forwarded our list of kitchen equipment two weeks ago, but we haven't heard back.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To return the other person to a previous topic to maintain focus:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Anyway, about the appointment, how about Thursday the 12th?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To take attention off of yourself by claiming lack of knowledge:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm afraid I personally don't know about that document. Let me find out.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "unlisted"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not listed on the telephone book"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It says unknown number on your phone because it's an unlisted number. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use in communication at work."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to put me through"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to connect a caller to someone else in the office"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Hi. Can you please put me through to the manager?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "appointment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a set meeting time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need to make an appointment with you to come in and do a review."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hold on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask the caller to wait a moment"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Could you hold on? I need to look at my calendar."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get back to you"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to send a reply later with more information"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let me find out about the document and get back to you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hear back "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to receive a reply by phone or e-mail"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We forwarded our list of kitchen equipment two weeks ago, but we haven't heard back."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "let me know"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask the other person to give you a reply when they find out the information"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Okay, once you find out, please let me know soon."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob02aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of a problem you might have had with your cell phone company or internet provider."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a phone dialogue or a text chat complaining about this problem. Use all the phrasal verbs that you have learned from this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the responses that you would expect from the company representative. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 8 - 10 lines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the dialogue aloud with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make complaints about a problem. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I manage a phone conversation using the proper action words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I reply to complaints. "}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs and work. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can manage a phone conversation."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can change topics."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Have you ever received a phone call from an unknown number?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Who was it?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What did you say to try to get off the phone quickly?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorre